(6725572, 1006660, 108069, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this is that I like shiny things.<br/> <br/>But after hours of <strike>wonderment</strike> examination, these are pennies and nickel pieces here! You''re broke as a joke. Even with the 20-cent pieces mixed in (quite obviously deliberately, by the way; not fooling me!) you still probably couldn''t buy us a round in Oslo.<br/> <br/>Sadly for you that''s the bar I''ve set for myself now. You cannot afford to buy me a drink in Oslo so you''ll never win this damn competition as long as I have a say.<br/> <br/>Otherwise it''s not horrible.</td>', 'My first impression of this is that I like shiny things. But after hours of wonderment examination, these are pennies and nickel pieces here! You''re broke as a joke. Even with the 20-cent pieces mixed in (quite obviously deliberately, by the way; not fooling me!) you still probably couldn''t buy us a round in Oslo. Sadly for you that''s the bar I''ve set for myself now. You cannot afford to buy me a drink in Oslo so you''ll never win this damn competition as long as I have a say. Otherwise it''s not horrible.', '2012-03-28 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
