(6726242, 1006750, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love how this was done.  At first, I thought to myself, how in the world did that actually stand.  Then, I realized, this shot was rotated (or shot upside down).  <br/> <br/>We started a shot glass collection, but after moving 5 times in the last 2 years, most of them didn''t make it.  :(<br/> <br/>Back to the picture. <br/>Nice clean black background, makes the shot glasses stand out. <br/>The lighting seems to cast a hard white reflection on some of the bottom shot glasses, which is somewhat distracting.  But other than that, I don''t see anything that could have been done much differently to improve this visually.</td>', 'Love how this was done.  At first, I thought to myself, how in the world did that actually stand.  Then, I realized, this shot was rotated (or shot upside down).   We started a shot glass collection, but after moving 5 times in the last 2 years, most of them didn''t make it.  :( Back to the picture. Nice clean black background, makes the shot glasses stand out. The lighting seems to cast a hard white reflection on some of the bottom shot glasses, which is somewhat distracting.  But other than that, I don''t see anything that could have been done much differently to improve this visually.', '2012-03-29 16:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726245, 1006547, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely guitars.  Nice angle.  Perhaps a different arrangement would have made this more appealing?  Or a clean background, such as a black backdrop?  The blinds and other guitars and stuff in the top left and bottom right corners are distracting to the shot.  It takes away from the main subject.  <br/>Also looks like it could be a little sharper to improve overall quality.  <br/>These are just my opinions, so take them however you''d like.  <br/>I really do like the idea you''ve had, I just think with a few differences, it could have really stood out.  Nice shot overall!</td>', 'Lovely guitars.  Nice angle.  Perhaps a different arrangement would have made this more appealing?  Or a clean background, such as a black backdrop?  The blinds and other guitars and stuff in the top left and bottom right corners are distracting to the shot.  It takes away from the main subject.  Also looks like it could be a little sharper to improve overall quality.  These are just my opinions, so take them however you''d like.  I really do like the idea you''ve had, I just think with a few differences, it could have really stood out.  Nice shot overall!', '2012-03-29 16:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726258, 1006628, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the crop of this, to make the wooden bookcase the only thing within the frame, actually creating a border with it.  Very well done.  The colors are nice, the detail is perfect.  Good light.  Very well shot and composed.</td>', 'Love the crop of this, to make the wooden bookcase the only thing within the frame, actually creating a border with it.  Very well done.  The colors are nice, the detail is perfect.  Good light.  Very well shot and composed.', '2012-03-29 16:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
