(6727757, 1006713, 140537, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of angle to present.<br/>It looks like you have really bad sensor dust.</td>', 'Interesting choice of angle to present.It looks like you have really bad sensor dust.', '2012-03-31 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6727759, 1005560, 140537, '<td valign="top">+ for making it look like they are in a sewer tunnel</td>', '+ for making it look like they are in a sewer tunnel', '2012-03-31 11:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6727813, 1006439, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting set up.  but I don''t get why she''s wearing fur?  the lighting is casting a dark shadow under one eye... making it appear like she has a black eye or a bag under her eye.  <br/>There''s nice detail, and the message is conveyed... <br/>overall, well done</td>', 'This is an interesting set up.  but I don''t get why she''s wearing fur?  the lighting is casting a dark shadow under one eye... making it appear like she has a black eye or a bag under her eye.  There''s nice detail, and the message is conveyed... overall, well done', '2012-03-31 13:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6727814, 1006300, 134859, '<td valign="top">like the processing done on this shot.</td>', 'like the processing done on this shot.', '2012-03-31 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6727816, 1006497, 134859, '<td valign="top">this is a neat collection... I think the lighting is taking away from the photo.</td>', 'this is a neat collection... I think the lighting is taking away from the photo.', '2012-03-31 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728074, 1006724, 38921, '<td valign="top">This one brings back some good memories...</td>', 'This one brings back some good memories...', '2012-04-01 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728075, 1006651, 38921, '<td valign="top">Disturbing, but in a good way.</td>', 'Disturbing, but in a good way.', '2012-04-01 00:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728251, 1006761, 141826, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!!!</td>', 'Magnificent!!!', '2012-04-01 07:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728252, 1006768, 141826, '<td valign="top">Joyful!!!</td>', 'Joyful!!!', '2012-04-01 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728255, 1006473, 141826, '<td valign="top">Which photo was cropped on the left.. Still nice one!</td>', 'Which photo was cropped on the left.. Still nice one!', '2012-04-01 07:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728258, 1006661, 91496, '<td valign="top">Ligthing works well here.  I like the composition with one ball outside of he glass.  The piece with the long stem seems out of place.  Perhaps the big ball could have gone upper left and a smaller ball placed outside.</td>', 'Ligthing works well here.  I like the composition with one ball outside of he glass.  The piece with the long stem seems out of place.  Perhaps the big ball could have gone upper left and a smaller ball placed outside.', '2012-04-01 07:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728259, 1006015, 141826, '<td valign="top">Valuable collection...</td>', 'Valuable collection...', '2012-04-01 07:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728260, 1006759, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of view.  The repetition of the albums in interesting a first glance but is too repetitive to hold my view for long.  Perhaps other angles or even a slight hint of color would have added some more impact to the image.</td>', 'Nice angle of view.  The repetition of the albums in interesting a first glance but is too repetitive to hold my view for long.  Perhaps other angles or even a slight hint of color would have added some more impact to the image.', '2012-04-01 07:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728261, 1006558, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative space on the right.  Not sure that it work that well with the rest of the composition.  Perhaps a much closer view to show all the details would be more powerful.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative space on the right.  Not sure that it work that well with the rest of the composition.  Perhaps a much closer view to show all the details would be more powerful.', '2012-04-01 07:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728263, 1005857, 91496, '<td valign="top">The lights and drapers appear to be the subject matter than the plates.  Perhaps lining the plates up where they overlap and shooting in close would give a more powerful composition.</td>', 'The lights and drapers appear to be the subject matter than the plates.  Perhaps lining the plates up where they overlap and shooting in close would give a more powerful composition.', '2012-04-01 07:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728264, 1005822, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the crop -- nice way of seeing.  Perhaps fewer headband isolated on on a black back drop would have allowed the colors to pop more.</td>', 'Love the crop -- nice way of seeing.  Perhaps fewer headband isolated on on a black back drop would have allowed the colors to pop more.', '2012-04-01 07:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728265, 1005769, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great framing and good use of DOF field here.  Not sure the subject is as photogenic and interesting as some of the others.</td>', 'Great framing and good use of DOF field here.  Not sure the subject is as photogenic and interesting as some of the others.', '2012-04-01 07:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728266, 1006720, 91496, '<td valign="top">The ornaments are hard to see here due to the case and the lighting.  Also try to get angles on your subject (the horse) rather than a static side shot.  Zoom in if you can to isolate your subject and remove some of the background.</td>', 'The ornaments are hard to see here due to the case and the lighting.  Also try to get angles on your subject (the horse) rather than a static side shot.  Zoom in if you can to isolate your subject and remove some of the background.', '2012-04-01 08:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728267, 1006761, 91496, '<td valign="top">The shells are inteesting with all the textures and such.  Not sure what a heart has to do with shell collecting and the heart has become your subject here rather than the shells.</td>', 'The shells are inteesting with all the textures and such.  Not sure what a heart has to do with shell collecting and the heart has become your subject here rather than the shells.', '2012-04-01 08:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728268, 1005959, 91496, '<td valign="top">The beadsd are colorful and I like the way the spill leads you into the photo.  You could try various crops with this image to zoom in on the spill and perhaps the bottom parts of the cup/jar to isolate your subject.</td>', 'The beadsd are colorful and I like the way the spill leads you into the photo.  You could try various crops with this image to zoom in on the spill and perhaps the bottom parts of the cup/jar to isolate your subject.', '2012-04-01 08:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728269, 1006488, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great still life.  Nicely lit.  Do you actually collect and keep the bread?  Otherwise it is kind of DNMC.</td>', 'Great still life.  Nicely lit.  Do you actually collect and keep the bread?  Otherwise it is kind of DNMC.', '2012-04-01 08:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728270, 1005746, 91496, '<td valign="top">Good idea here with the low angle of view.  A paneled crop would eliminate all the foreground, to isolate your subject.  You could also play with the angles of the shoes to see if there were other compositions that had more of a wow factor.</td>', 'Good idea here with the low angle of view.  A paneled crop would eliminate all the foreground, to isolate your subject.  You could also play with the angles of the shoes to see if there were other compositions that had more of a wow factor.', '2012-04-01 08:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728275, 1006724, 91496, '<td valign="top">Good image.  The lighting and reflections are great.  Love the DOF.  Perhaps move Pacman to the front, as the pitfall relection area is prominent in the image but is just blank and boring.</td>', 'Good image.  The lighting and reflections are great.  Love the DOF.  Perhaps move Pacman to the front, as the pitfall relection area is prominent in the image but is just blank and boring.', '2012-04-01 08:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728276, 1006488, 141826, '<td valign="top">Great idea... Very efficient!!!</td>', 'Great idea... Very efficient!!!', '2012-04-01 08:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728278, 1006536, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great angle and DOF.  The fingers and tweezeers make the image.  Ditch the letter box border, it adds nothing to the image.</td>', 'Great angle and DOF.  The fingers and tweezeers make the image.  Ditch the letter box border, it adds nothing to the image.', '2012-04-01 08:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728279, 1006525, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great colors, comppostion, and DOF.  The Carib looks unaturally standing up, otherwise a intersting image.</td>', 'Great colors, comppostion, and DOF.  The Carib looks unaturally standing up, otherwise a intersting image.', '2012-04-01 08:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728281, 1006750, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and great black backgorund.  You almost have the illusion of this standing upright except for the bottom 3 odd sized glasses.  I think a working illusion would be a much more powerful composition.  The crop is a bit tight at the top, leave a little more breathing space.</td>', 'Nice colors and great black backgorund.  You almost have the illusion of this standing upright except for the bottom 3 odd sized glasses.  I think a working illusion would be a much more powerful composition.  The crop is a bit tight at the top, leave a little more breathing space.', '2012-04-01 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728283, 1006547, 91496, '<td valign="top">Dice knobs!!!  Good angle of view.  Blinds in the back are kind of a distraction.</td>', 'Dice knobs!!!  Good angle of view.  Blinds in the back are kind of a distraction.', '2012-04-01 08:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728288, 1006449, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Perhaps try other angles of view (tilted) to see if thtat worked.  The silver boring caps could be replaced with other more colorful caps to give more of a wow factor.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Perhaps try other angles of view (tilted) to see if thtat worked.  The silver boring caps could be replaced with other more colorful caps to give more of a wow factor.', '2012-04-01 08:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728289, 1006300, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view here.  Not sure the lighting/procesing works for me.</td>', 'I like the angle of view here.  Not sure the lighting/procesing works for me.', '2012-04-01 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728290, 1006351, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The wide angle lens effet here does not work for me.  For a collection challenge there may be too much (sky, bulding, bird) competing wth you subject.</td>', 'Nice colors.  The wide angle lens effet here does not work for me.  For a collection challenge there may be too much (sky, bulding, bird) competing wth you subject.', '2012-04-01 08:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728292, 1006393, 91496, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept here and the diffused focus.  However the negative space in the photo and especially the border is a distraction.  Also is the subject frames, pictures, or memories.</td>', 'I really like the concept here and the diffused focus.  However the negative space in the photo and especially the border is a distraction.  Also is the subject frames, pictures, or memories.', '2012-04-01 08:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728295, 1006309, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint.  I both like and dislike this angle.  The center of the frame is the farthest from the view which is odd.  On the other hand I like how the upright pages from the photo.  Perhaps the same view with  wider focal length would be something to try.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint.  I both like and dislike this angle.  The center of the frame is the farthest from the view which is odd.  On the other hand I like how the upright pages from the photo.  Perhaps the same view with  wider focal length would be something to try.', '2012-04-01 08:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728297, 1006615, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup.  I like hte blur on the film.  You may have a movie collection, but this photo does not represent it, so kind of DMNC.</td>', 'Nice closeup.  I like hte blur on the film.  You may have a movie collection, but this photo does not represent it, so kind of DMNC.', '2012-04-01 08:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728300, 1006472, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wild composition.  The shapes, patterns, and shaows make it hard to determine the edges of each instrument.  Perhaps filling is the shadows with a reflector or in post would have provided more impact.  Well done.</td>', 'Wild composition.  The shapes, patterns, and shaows make it hard to determine the edges of each instrument.  Perhaps filling is the shadows with a reflector or in post would have provided more impact.  Well done.', '2012-04-01 08:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728306, 1006439, 91496, '<td valign="top">So you collect fur covered women :)  <br/> <br/>While technically meeting the challenge, I think perhaps you missed the spirit of it.  As far as the photo goes, nicely lit and good use of an interesting angle of view.</td>', 'So you collect fur covered women :)   While technically meeting the challenge, I think perhaps you missed the spirit of it.  As far as the photo goes, nicely lit and good use of an interesting angle of view.', '2012-04-01 08:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728322, 1006626, 118154, '<td valign="top">It all seems very out of focus.</td>', 'It all seems very out of focus.', '2012-04-01 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728324, 1005966, 118154, '<td valign="top">Think the lighting and composition are not good ,putting a light source to one side would have certainly improved things.</td>', 'Think the lighting and composition are not good ,putting a light source to one side would have certainly improved things.', '2012-04-01 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728327, 1006672, 118154, '<td valign="top">Love the light here,weird stuff.</td>', 'Love the light here,weird stuff.', '2012-04-01 09:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728328, 1006651, 118154, '<td valign="top">Don,t think folks will be too keen on this image.</td>', 'Don,t think folks will be too keen on this image.', '2012-04-01 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728330, 1005568, 118154, '<td valign="top">This shot is so strange.</td>', 'This shot is so strange.', '2012-04-01 09:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728331, 1006746, 118154, '<td valign="top">Keen faces.</td>', 'Keen faces.', '2012-04-01 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728332, 1006657, 118154, '<td valign="top">Makes for a great image,nice processing.</td>', 'Makes for a great image,nice processing.', '2012-04-01 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
