(6728478, 1006663, 134859, '<td valign="top">My boys want this collection!  We still have to get it for them.  <br/>I like the way this was set up.<br/> <br/>Did you try other angles?  Perhaps getting lower, so we could see them straight forward.  Just another option to consider.</td>', 'My boys want this collection!  We still have to get it for them.  I like the way this was set up. Did you try other angles?  Perhaps getting lower, so we could see them straight forward.  Just another option to consider.', '2012-04-01 13:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728479, 1006754, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows being cast in this shot.  Interesting set up here.</td>', 'I like the shadows being cast in this shot.  Interesting set up here.', '2012-04-01 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728481, 1006746, 134859, '<td valign="top">Aww... they are adorable.  I''m not fond of the color of this shot, perhaps a black and white would have been better (IMO), but I do like the shot.</td>', 'Aww... they are adorable.  I''m not fond of the color of this shot, perhaps a black and white would have been better (IMO), but I do like the shot.', '2012-04-01 13:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
