(6728485, 1006516, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a different collection.  I like the composition of these, and the colors are very vibrant.</td>', 'This is a different collection.  I like the composition of these, and the colors are very vibrant.', '2012-04-01 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728486, 1006634, 134859, '<td valign="top">Different shot.  Interesting.  I like the sun shining through the window, and the tilt of the camera.</td>', 'Different shot.  Interesting.  I like the sun shining through the window, and the tilt of the camera.', '2012-04-01 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728487, 1005959, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lots and lots of beads!  I remember playing with beads as a kid.  I loved them.  I like the spill, adds interest to the shot.  Good DOF as well.</td>', 'Lots and lots of beads!  I remember playing with beads as a kid.  I loved them.  I like the spill, adds interest to the shot.  Good DOF as well.', '2012-04-01 13:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728488, 1006500, 134859, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a little OOF.  I like the concept of this shot.</td>', 'The shot looks a little OOF.  I like the concept of this shot.', '2012-04-01 13:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728489, 1006622, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of this, and that''s a beautiful painting.</td>', 'Love the angle of this, and that''s a beautiful painting.', '2012-04-01 13:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728490, 1005882, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the lighting in this shot... it''s a little too dark for my liking; being said, I understand the direct lighting on the one figure... just a little too dark, IMO.  But I do like the concept.</td>', 'Not fond of the lighting in this shot... it''s a little too dark for my liking; being said, I understand the direct lighting on the one figure... just a little too dark, IMO.  But I do like the concept.', '2012-04-01 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728492, 1006569, 134859, '<td valign="top">I almost did a marble collection as well.  I love marbles.  It looks OOF, and the angle of the table is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I almost did a marble collection as well.  I love marbles.  It looks OOF, and the angle of the table is somewhat distracting.', '2012-04-01 13:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728496, 1006568, 134859, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little small.  It also looks OOF.<br/>However, I do like the collection you''ve photographed.</td>', 'This photo is a little small.  It also looks OOF.However, I do like the collection you''ve photographed.', '2012-04-01 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
