(6731846, 1006651, 137576, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote (busy week) but I''d have given you a ten, I love it. Love sticking two fingers up at the oh so safe conservatives on here, which is clear from your comments. I''d maybe have liked the knive stuck through a photo into a chopping board so it stood up etc but might have over egged the pudding. For all those stupid comments it''s an idea for a photo challenge it''s not real life, get out of your 1 dimensional boxes. Top work josh :)</td>', 'I didn''t vote (busy week) but I''d have given you a ten, I love it. Love sticking two fingers up at the oh so safe conservatives on here, which is clear from your comments. I''d maybe have liked the knive stuck through a photo into a chopping board so it stood up etc but might have over egged the pudding. For all those stupid comments it''s an idea for a photo challenge it''s not real life, get out of your 1 dimensional boxes. Top work josh :)', '2012-04-04 04:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
